{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"The nameless smiles and nods. \"What work we're you doing?\" He asks.","created_at":"2021-07-20T05:24:12.440000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866913363963281419","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"\"Oh y'know, shipping. Loading and unloading. Lot of overseeing for me, but lots of lifting, too.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T05:28:54.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866914548653228092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"\"I see.\" The nameless decides to hold off of small talk. \"Uhhh, I've spent the couple of days looking for you actually.\" He says with a slightly awkward smile while rubbing the back of his head.","created_at":"2021-07-20T05:30:16.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866914890806460446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"Prosser chuckles lightly. \"Something you need to say to me?\" They raise their eyebrows jokingly.","created_at":"2021-07-20T05:33:45.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866915767075995668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"\"I was told to find you by a trio of other fey, Sonora, Edriata, and Darrie. I asked them for people to talk to for helping to fend off the redcoats. They told me that you could help me find Trapero.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T05:36:05.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866916352672268309","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"\"Ah, so you're after my sibling. Well I can help, though it won't be simple.\" They study you. \"I trust you, after that squid business. And I highly doubt any redcoat spy would end up losing their name.\" They stretch and begin to stand up.","created_at":"2021-07-20T05:48:00.927000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866919355471888464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
